# 2026-11-15: day 12 is reached from the calendar's "Show year picker" button, 44 pt right and 146 pt down from its centre (from --dump-tree), so the tap does not depend on how far the scroll went. A label of "12" also matches the clock faces. / 第 12 日由日曆的「Show year picker」按鈕中心往右 44 pt、往下 146 pt 取得(取自 --dump-tree),點擊因此不受捲動距離影響。「12」這個標籤也會比對到時鐘面。
